Debian 13 (trixie) experimental packages
==========================================

These packages target Debian 13 amd64, not Debian 12 or an unverified Ubuntu
version. Web and link dependencies use Debian 13's official repositories.

Core: liner-notes
Optional browser connector: liner-notes-web
Optional BBS shared-board connector: liner-notes-link

Installation and upgrade NEVER start, stop, enable or restart systemd services.
Configure the BBS, initialize an administrator and review existing databases
before manually starting services. Removal leaves BBS data and service
accounts intact. Save /etc/liner-notes, /var/lib/liner-notes*, signing keys
and game data in consistent backups before upgrading. See DEB.md.
